@startuml Scenariu4_Stergere
title Scenariul 4 – Răzgândire (ștergere linie din memorie)\n(Student 4 – TestScenariul4Stergere)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #EFF5FF
skinparam participantBorderColor #1F6FEB
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #1F6FEB

actor "Test" as Test
participant "form : ReceptieFormCtrl" as Ctrl
participant "formData : ReceptieFormData" as Data
participant "docRepo : DocumentRepository" as DRepo
participant "masterRepo : MasterRepository" as MRepo

Test -> Ctrl  : documentNou()
Test -> Ctrl  : adaugaReceptie()
Test -> Ctrl  : adaugaLinieIntrare()
Test -> Ctrl  : adaugaLinieIntrare()

Test -> Data  : getReceptieSelectata().getLiniiIntrare().get(1)
Data --> Test : linie2
Test -> Data  : getReceptieSelectata().removeLinieIntrare(linie2)
note right : stergere DOAR din memorie\nniciun DELETE in BD

Test -> Data  : getReceptieSelectata().getLiniiIntrare().size()
Data --> Test : 1  ✔

Test -> Ctrl  : salveazaModificariDocument()
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> DRepo : beginTransaction()
Ctrl -> DRepo : saveDocInsotitor(doc)
note right : INSERT doar linie1\nlinie2 nu a ajuns in BD
DRepo --> Ctrl : DocInsotitor (cu ID)
Ctrl -> MRepo : actualizeazaStoc(doc)
note right : UPDATE stoc doar\npentru linie1
Ctrl -> DRepo : commitTransaction()
deactivate Ctrl

@enduml
